---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftRegressionTest
---
Construct a RegressionTest draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Create executable test specifications using approved harness capabilities and isolated fixtures. Define deterministic setup, observable assertions, and cleanup; avoid brittle checks on incidental wording or timing unless those are actually contractual.
